%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9e0fed1f137f4046a2b3cc32542e6d2, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialGame
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorials:
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: -8254932462476682504, guid: 80802cf9fa320fc419f77e97c1f72b20, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Chemistry Time
    tutorialDescription: Helooo.. Welcome to Chemistry Time, I will guide you how
      to play this game
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: 6575399595192530103, guid: a6444ee7ee461884a93df37de8c5e4e2, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Inventory
    tutorialDescription: You can see your inventory in here, like Carbon, Hydrogen,
      Oxygen, Nitrogen and plant you have
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: 6632562118931094677, guid: 066cb9ab298e7b04e8d78574a12a195d, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Plant
    tutorialDescription: You can get plant by Interact this object using E
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: -4084257871133270774, guid: 6f949509e9cb15345a21b6bbacd068a6, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Ekstraktor
    tutorialDescription: You can change 1 plant into C 45, H 45, O 6, N 4. You can
      interact it using E
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: 8293026253538579910, guid: 9670c9be3aeb65140af403a056348d42, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Combiner
    tutorialDescription: Dont forget to stay hydrated by interact this using E, but
      you need a least H 2 and O 1. You can see your bar in the right screen.
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: 5413676945812881591, guid: b00d86ef20909204192b5a5d11cb6f28, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Enemy
    tutorialDescription: The enemy will spawned and you need to kill it before touching
      you or your base. You can kill it by shoot with the right formula
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: 1451361546513913597, guid: 6650cc55802b0984998788f835917d40, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Weapon
    tutorialDescription: You can change the formula of your wapon by click it
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: 4555765647353051164, guid: 906af4c53a0adcb44a1214cb47315232, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Weapon
    tutorialDescription: You can see your current weapon formula in here. You can
      shoot by click SPACE on your keyboard
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: -6782939379008594277, guid: 369d994f541a9684fa12f3353d31a436, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Dictionary
    tutorialDescription: If you dont know the formula, you can check it in here.
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: 6169095828216602985, guid: 1ad5e93071ad5d041b3c7c6000457951, type: 3}
    tutorialName: Skill
    tutorialDescription: Also, you can press Q to summon Shield. And press F to summon
      Nuke. :D
  - tutorialImage: {fileID: -8254932462476682504, guid: 80802cf9fa320fc419f77e97c1f72b20, type: 3}
    tutorialName: GOODLUCK
    tutorialDescription: Goodluck, I hope you like this game :D
